{"title":"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the tens digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5a55875f8fdc092dcbce4590fcf7096608deaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2011}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/3/ba35794c7ca97cbcd108fbb65e1e4bf27bca0a5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }0\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }1\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }3\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }4\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since we want the tens digit, we can find the last two digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5a55875f8fdc092dcbce4590fcf7096608deaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2011}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />.  We can do this by using modular arithmetic.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/4/d3414d6de021de10a7868a9d21959e6d07811219.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7^1\\equiv 07 \\pmod{100}.\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/5/b25cc8f14de391dad5f5095a71454e1aac0169d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7^2\\equiv 49 \\pmod{100}.\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f227121a150f2b3b6823ed4b74195e3dfced959.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7^3\\equiv 43 \\pmod{100}.\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/b/cbb215ba3e81c1db4c3afa7084526922b7aa6698.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7^4\\equiv 01 \\pmod{100}.\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"19\" />\nWe can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5a55875f8fdc092dcbce4590fcf7096608deaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2011}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/a/11ab308f2d5a0428ab8a0349fe45c1c4cfa0c687.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7^4)^{502}\\times 7^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"19\" />.  Using this, we can say:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f813cc0903206245e648b3ea84edc41eaf85a6d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7^{2011}\\equiv (7^4)^{502}\\times 7^3\\equiv 7^3\\equiv 343\\equiv 43\\pmod{100}.\\]\" width=\"388\" height=\"19\" />\nFrom the above, we can conclude that the last two digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5a55875f8fdc092dcbce4590fcf7096608deaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2011}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> are 43.  Since they have asked us to find the tens digit, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d16dd80db301d5881327dd52d70d4773fc412c5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>-Ilovefruits\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The last two digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5a55875f8fdc092dcbce4590fcf7096608deaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2011}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> can be found by taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d8f78809c33085a54ea1005055682e9a958092.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5a55875f8fdc092dcbce4590fcf7096608deaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2011}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />. By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euler%27s_Totient_Theorem\" title=\"Euler&#39;s Totient Theorem\">Euler's Totient Theorem</a>, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/9/6796d21c316079dfa62d39ee1c54445aad625240.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{\\phi(100)}\\equiv 7^{40}\\equiv 1 \\pmod{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"221\" height=\"23\" />, so we can conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/e/d4e15de5b8eca503b2a83f5cfa639805afaac371.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2011} \\equiv 7^{40^{50}} \\cdot 7^{11}\\equiv 7^{11} \\pmod{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"272\" height=\"24\" />. We can find that the modular inverse of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/0/250708b5942b1627056892ceabd721189796995d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 \\pmod{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/8/c38d81afc2fb4328ead7dde7d51221bdbac7bc53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$43$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c8b1c20470b9c91d61bfb077467df03b7c2af43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{12}\\equiv 01 \\pmod{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"21\" />, we can conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34cb2a28a46c7952bb0942cf8362914e95998edf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{11}\\equiv 7^{12} \\cdot 7^{-1}\\equiv 1 \\cdot 43\\equiv 43 \\pmod{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"310\" height=\"21\" />. The problem asked for the tens digit, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d16dd80db301d5881327dd52d70d4773fc412c5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n~Baihly2024\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=1710\">https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=1710</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/lxtYmUzQQ8w\">https://youtu.be/lxtYmUzQQ8w</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 8\">2011 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2011\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.